Hej Bo

Jeg har vedh=C3=A6ftet et par klip fra det lukkede MuseScore Forum, jeg n=
=C3=A6vnte.

I =C3=A9t af dem st=C3=A5r bl. a.

(Citat)
But to me, the interesting thing about the IBOS utility is its interactiven=
ess, the way it will let you browse measure by measures, instrument by inst=
rument, etc, and hear playback too.

I downloaded and gave it a brief try, seems extremely promising. 

(Citat slut)



Og s=C3=A5 her jeg Googlet Mark Sabatella, som skriver de p=C3=A6ne ord. Ha=
n er tilsyneladende chef for MuseScores undervisningsafdeling: 

https://masteringmusescore.com/author/marcsabatella/

indeholder bl.a f=C3=B8lgende:

=E2=80=9CColorado-based musician Marc Sabatella is Director of Education fo=
r MuseScore. A long-time contributor to the project, he is one of the devel=
opers of the software and the author of the comprehensive resource Masterin=
g MuseScore, offered as an online course, a paperback available in both Eng=
lish and French, and a Kindle edition. He has been been a pioneer in online=
 teaching since the dawn of the world wide web, and his Jazz Improvisation =
Primer was one of the very first music education sites ever to appear on th=
e Internet.=E2=80=9D

S=C3=A5 han er fra Colorado og osse jazz-musiker. Jeg havde godt s=C3=A9t a=
t der ogs=C3=A5 var en jazz-musiker med samme navn, men havde ikke fanget, =
at det tilsyneladende er =C3=A9n og samme person!

H=C3=A9r er hans LinkedIn profil:

https://www.linkedin.com/in/marc-sabatella-bb799a140


S=C3=A5 han er da vist ikke en hr. hvemsomhelst..

mvh Jens

